silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_15_witness_traceability_sections_03_ledger_row_anatomy_concrete_anchor_2#sections_01_thesis_tex silm:hasLongDescription "The sections/01_thesis.tex is sections/01_thesis.tex is the edit_target value in the joc620 ledger row. It is the rightmost target node in the ledger row anatomy diagram. The typed morphism from the joc620 witness on disk terminates here. The weaver verifies the edit_diff_sha field by byte-checking the diff hunk against this file at Tier 4." .
